<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>RFD FLOW OC - Every business in OC</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#0a0a12;color:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;min-height:100vh}
.header{padding:14px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;background:#11111b;border-bottom:1px solid #1f1f2e;position:sticky;top:0}
.logo{display:flex;gap:10px;font-weight:900}
.logo-mark{width:32px;height:20px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7CFF6B,#4ADE80);border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;color:#000;font-weight:900}
.hero{padding:24px 20px 18px}
.hero h1{font-size:36px;line-height:0.95;font-weight:900}
.hero h1 span.orange{color:#FF6B2B}
.hero p{color:#9ca3af;margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
.search-box{background:#14141f;border:1px solid #252538;border-radius:20px;padding:14px;margin:16px}
.input{width:100%;background:#fff;color:#000;border:none;border-radius:24px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:10px}
.row{display:flex;gap:10px}
.select{background:#fff;color:#000;border:none;border-radius:16px;padding:12px 16px;font-weight:700}
.btn-search{flex:1;background:#FF6B2B;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:16px;font-weight:800;font-size:16px}
.tags{padding:0 16px 18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.tag{background:#1c1c2a;border:1px solid #2a2a3a;color:#a1a1b5;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px}
.grid{padding:10px 12px 100px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.card{background:#13131f;border:1px solid #242438;border-radius:20px;padding:16px}
.card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:24px}
.icon{width:44px;height:44px;background:#0f0f18;border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px}
.count{font-size:12px;background:#1e1e2e;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700}
.card h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}
.verified{font-size:11px;color:#8b8ba3;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header"><div class="logo"><div class="logo-mark">RFD</div> RFD FLOW OC</div><div>≡</div></div>
<div class="hero">
<h1>Every business in<br>OC.<br>Find your <span class="orange">exact</span><br>one.</h1>
<p>Barbers, tacos, auto shops, contractors, lawyers, gyms, dentists, cleaners, shops - all local businesses in one place. Filter by your neighborhood, your budget, your exact need. No chains unless local franchise. No spam.</p>
</div>
<div class="search-box">
<input class="input" placeholder="What? barber, tacos, plumber...">
<input class="input" placeholder="Where? Irvine, Santa Ana...">
<div class="row">
<select class="select"><option>Any</option><option>$25-$40</option></select>
<button class="btn-search">Search</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="tags"><div class="tag">200+ Businesses</div><div class="tag">Verified Local</div><div class="tag">No Chains</div><div class="tag">Theft Protected</div></div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">✂️</div><div class="count">34</div></div><h3>Barbers & Salons</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">🌮</div><div class="count">41</div></div><h3>Tacos & Food Trucks</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">🔧</div><div class="count">28</div></div><h3>Auto Shops</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">🏗️</div><div class="count">22</div></div><h3>Contractors</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">⚖️</div><div class="count">18</div></div><h3>Lawyers</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">💪</div><div class="count">26</div></div><h3>Gyms & Trainers</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">🦷</div><div class="count">15</div></div><h3>Dentists</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">🧹</div><div class="count">19</div></div><h3>Cleaners</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">🛍️</div><div class="count">38</div></div><h3>Local Shops</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-top"><div class="icon">🚿</div><div class="count">17</div></div><h3>Plumbers</h3><div class="verified"><div class="dot"></div> Verified OC only</div></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
